Subject: [PATCH 159/159] LOCAL: arm64: configs: nairo: Build AW8695 driver

Build the haptics driver as a module.

This patch was generated by an AI coding assistant (Claude Opus 5.5 in
Claude Code) during an interactive bring-up session on a Motorola Moto G
5G Plus (XT2075-3, "nairo"). It has not yet been reviewed line by line
by a human and needs that review before any submission.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config b/arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config
index da2b05681aad..ff8db8c3ddf6 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config
@@ -84,3 +84,4 @@ CONFIG_REGULATOR_QCOM_LCDB=m
 # Display clock controller built in: simpledrm must claim the display
 # clocks before unused clocks are switched off at late init
 CONFIG_SM_DISPCC_8250=y
+CONFIG_INPUT_AW8695=m
